<title>USA: TABLE - Worldtex Inc Q2 shr slips to $0.14.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Worldtex Inc Q2 shr slips to $0.14.</headline>
<dateline>HICKORY, N.C. 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.14		    $0.22</p>
<p> Net			  2,029		    3,226</p>
<p> Revs			51,880		   53,140</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	14,740		   14,592</p>
<p>	   6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.32		    $0.41</p>
<p> Net			  4,695		    5,926</p>
<p> Revs		     102,798		  105,039</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	14,836		   14,571</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q2 sales and net hurt by impact of French currency translation. The French Franc translation to U.S. dollars caused sales from its French operations to decline by 11 percent, a spokesman said. Exact figures on the sales decline were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
